==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*10 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dual]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragons]] easily take care of the boss, just be sure to protect them from the onslaught of peons that aim to disrupt your forces. Use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist/Ramen Cat]] to hold the frontline, and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] to take care of the Cyberhorns when they appear.

